WEBVTT

00:00:00.830 --> 00:00:04.560
Give the Love Lab Correspondence a read.

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:16.480
<b>Love Lab Correspondence: 
</b>For Those Who Want to Fall in Love<b></b>

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:09.310
"Mayu shook her head.

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:13.620
'I'm chubby, aren't I? I can't 
get a boyfriend like this.'

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:16.490
However, Yuki smiled and told her..."

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:22.790
Is this our answer to "do 
boys not like chubby girls?"

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:26.090
Momo-senpai wrote it like a story.

00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:28.380
Mayu and Yuki are fictional characters.

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:31.090
No one will think they actually exist.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.970
Are you saying you'll turn 
our responses into stories?

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:34.960
<b>Hard Work</b>

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:37.760
Even if we're found out,
 we can talk our way out of it.

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:40.720
We also can't be receiving 
too many requests,

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:43.510
so I'm thinking of making a 
suggestion box for the paper.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:43.540
<b>Cute</b>

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:45.390
I love Yuki!

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.290
You harassed us so much before.

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:50.360
What's your angle?

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:55.580
We wanted you to acknowledge our 
abilities, achievements, and passion.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:57.630
That's all, honest.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:00.350
With some luck, we hoped 
for a promotion to a club.

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:01.700
And a significant increase in our budget.

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:03.080
That wasn't all, then!

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:04.940
I knew something was suspicious.

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:07.380
The risk is too large for you.

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:09.540
If the school finds out,

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:12.550
we can place all the blame 
on the newspaper club.

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:16.380
You can make us your 
scapegoat if that happens.

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:17.430
What?

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:20.010
Maki-san, thank you.

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:23.760
You spoke with the contest's office

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:27.650
so our association could participate in 
the summer newspaper contest, right?

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:30.940
Thanks to you, we're being 
allowed to participate.

00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:32.920
Maki, you...

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:35.240
I was going to tell you later.

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:37.660
You went the extra mile for us.

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:39.160
We've made up our minds.

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:43.870
A journalist who can't take responsibility 
for her articles isn't a journalist at all!

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:47.580
More than anything, it's unfair if 
the student council are the only ones

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:48.800
doing something so interesting.

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.670
We want to be your partners in crime.

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:56.650
If things go well, we want a promotion.

00:01:56.650 --> 00:01:58.160
And an increase in our budget.

00:01:58.160 --> 00:01:59.720
Yeah, <i>if </i>things go well!

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:31.890
What do you think?

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:34.490
I hate to admit it, 
but it's a good idea.

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:36.020
It'll take some of the pressure off us.

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:38.030
I'm all for it!

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:40.360
Maki, what should we do?

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:42.890
<b>Be My Friend Forever</b>

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.860
We should be careful in our decision.

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:45.870
This will affect people's 
trust in the student council.

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:47.740
You're right.

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:52.620
We need to conduct more love labs 
and have them turned into articles!

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:54.500
You've already made your decision.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.130
I'm going to go running!

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:56.840
Why?

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:02.310
I'm practicing techniques to make my long, black,
 straight hair flutter in a way that boys like!

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:13.520
I'm so lonely!

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:17.440
You're the only one with 
long, black, straight hair.

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:21.860
Fine, we'll watch you from the window.

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:26.240
Yeah, it's waving nicely.

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:29.180
This is lonely, too!

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:33.590
Why are you so worked up?

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:35.750
It's my first time.

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:40.840
Sharing a secret with everyone, and 
starting something together like this.

00:04:41.310 --> 00:04:42.300
Maki...

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:45.680
So I couldn't bear to just sit still.

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:48.660
Our love lab is finally turning 
into something tangible.

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:51.020
We need to do things even 
better than we have before.

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:53.730
I'm counting on you, Master Riko.

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:57.770
I... I'm going for a run!

00:04:58.280 --> 00:04:59.420
Why?

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:03.710
I can't keep this up much longer.

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:05.610
I need to do something soon.

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:08.810
Why don't you tell them you were 
never popular in all your life?

00:05:08.810 --> 00:05:10.990
Don't crush my future's potential, too!

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:15.160
You should tell them and 
apologize before it's too late.

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:17.630
I don't know what to say now...

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.710
You'll have to think about that yourself.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:22.620
You're so cold!

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:24.590
Who cares? Don't ask me!

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:27.720
Help me, Sayo-senpai.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:29.060
Brrr...

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:33.600
Sayo-senpai!

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:37.300
<b>Irikimi Cram School</b>

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:37.310
<i>They just think I have a 
lot of romantic experience.</i>

00:05:37.590 --> 00:05:39.470
<i>I'm not fooling them because I want to.</i>

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:41.940
<i>Maki's an important friend to me.</i>

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:48.740
I just came to repay you 
for hurting my friend!

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:51.830
I'm not trying to be helpful 
because of a guilty conscience!

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:53.220
What are you talking about?!

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:56.120
You called Maki "Natsuo"!

00:05:56.430 --> 00:05:57.850
What's your point?

00:05:57.850 --> 00:06:00.290
Her name is Natsuo Maki, isn't it?

00:06:00.550 --> 00:06:01.300
Huh?

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:04.360
What? It's Maki Natsuo?!

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:07.050
You call her Maki, so I thought...

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.550
You should've at least made 
sure you had her name right.

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:12.530
Damn it.

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:15.430
I don't usually make such stupid mistakes.

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:18.440
Things always go wrong 
when I'm dealing with her.

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:20.600
Yan, you...

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:23.070
You like Maki, don't you?

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:28.370
Why do you say that?!

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:30.800
Try taking a second look at what you said.

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:32.130
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:33.460
She's too weird!

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:34.240
What?!

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:37.580
She is weird, but don't <i>you</i> call her that!

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:40.600
Maki's a really pure and nice girl!

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:41.750
That's why...

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:44.340
Are you a master of love?

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:46.920
I see, you're a master of love.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.260
Please, Master!

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:50.620
That's why...

00:06:51.030 --> 00:06:53.170
If you want to say something, just say it.

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:54.510
It makes you look stupid when you don't.

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:55.830
Hey, you!

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:00.240
I want to...

00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:03.220
I want to tell her.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:05.900
Okay.

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:08.430
I'll tell her tomorrow!

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:12.990
I'm going to be attending that 
cram school starting next week.

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:16.480
<i>If Maki comes to cram school, she'll 
find out about my lie in a heartbeat.</i>

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:18.600
<i>I need to keep their mouths shut...</i>

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:21.390
<i>No, I need to 'fess up and apologize.</i>

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:22.620
Maki, the truth is...

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:25.790
I'll be counting on your help 
at cram school, Master Riko.

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:29.760
I've got cram school today. I'm going to go.

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:32.280
<i>You coward!</i>

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:35.460
I'm going there to turn 
in my paperwork today.

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:37.010
Let's go together.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:43.230
<i>I'll tell her before we get to cram school.</i>

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:47.020
<i>If there's a break in the conversation, 
that's when I'll tell her.</i>

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:51.280
Our conversation was so interesting, 
we got here before we knew it.

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:55.030
<i>You ultra coward!</i>

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:58.520
Headmaster's Office

00:07:55.940 --> 00:07:58.540
I'm going to turn in my paperwork.

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:00.880
Sure, see you later.

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:05.050
<i>I need to keep Nagi and Yan 
quiet before Maki runs into them.</i>

00:08:06.390 --> 00:08:07.610
Excuse me.

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:11.380
Oh...

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:13.430
<i>What was her name again?</i>

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:14.840
Um...

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:17.870
<i>I need to act properly, 
even if he is a boy.</i>

00:08:18.670 --> 00:08:22.720
Hello, Riko's childhood friend who was 
in love with her and then was rejected!

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:24.600
Wait, that never happened!

00:08:24.860 --> 00:08:26.540
I'd never fall in love with her!

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:27.430
What?

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:29.480
Just because Riko is unattainable,

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.530
you shouldn't forget 
your memories together!

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:33.360
It's not like that!

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:35.550
Nagi, Yan?

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:38.490
They're not here yet?

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:40.570
Where is Irikimi-sensei?

00:08:40.570 --> 00:08:42.160
Looks like he's out somewhere.

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:44.000
I wanted to talk to him, too.

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:46.450
Why don't you sit while you wait?

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:48.210
You're right.

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:51.410
<i>Does she not suspect Riko's lie at all?</i>

00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:53.380
<i>Maybe I'll ask her.</i>

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:59.260
<i>Wait, am I alone in a closed 
room with a boy right now?</i>

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:00.800
Hey, listen...

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:06.230
Huh? Uh, um...

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:08.600
Um...

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:14.240
This wall has a nice sound!

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.910
Oh, I'm really into walls.

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:18.850
Don't mind me.

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:20.330
I-I see...

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:22.430
So, anyway...

00:09:24.990 --> 00:09:28.060
What a folksy feel! Très bien!

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:31.040
Not even a curtain maniac like 
me can keep her mouth shut!

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:35.590
<i>She's really cute, but...</i>

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:38.010
<i>She's really weird!</i>

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:42.310
Are you uncomfortable around boys?

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:48.690
Hey, Sacchan. Looking cute again today.

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.060
Satoshi-kun, you're so cute.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.620
Nagi, you don't seem like a boy at all.

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:55.030
Let us give you a makeover.

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:57.400
<i>Th-This is new to me!</i>

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:00.620
You don't seem to have much 
in common with girls like Riko.

00:10:01.050 --> 00:10:02.700
Where did you meet her?

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:06.620
Sh-She helped me when I was in trouble.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.830
I wanted to be her friend after that.

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:12.560
I know I cause her a lot of trouble,

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:15.300
and she always seems annoyed...

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:19.130
But she's rather kind, 
and she's so cool...

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:21.260
Well, I guess you could say 
she takes care of people.

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:23.360
She's a good friend.

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:26.810
Yes. I can understand why 
you fell in love with her.

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.730
Where did that come from?!

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:31.080
What? Is that not what happened?

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:32.900
There's no way Riko's popu—

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:34.820
What about Riko?

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:40.160
Man, where did they go?

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:41.640
Hey, Riko.

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:43.180
Nagi.

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:46.660
Listen, I have a favor to ask you.

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:49.160
My friend who came by the other day...

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:50.830
I just ran into her.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:52.290
She's starting next week, right?

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:54.300
That makes things easy—

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:55.100
What?!

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:57.720
I told her about your past.

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:59.000
Really?

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:01.440
Then I guess it's too late 
to ask you that favor...

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:03.180
Wait, what?!

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:06.110
You're a mean one, aren't you?

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:08.760
I can't believe you lied to such a nice girl.

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:11.700
I have to apologize.

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:12.220
Huh?

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:15.250
I have to apologize to Maki.

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:16.530
I'm sorry, Maki.

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:17.110
I'm sorry!

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:18.070
W-Wait!

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:19.670
I'm kidding!

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:21.320
I didn't tell her anything!

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:25.180
You liar!

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:27.200
You're a liar, too!

00:11:27.630 --> 00:11:29.410
If you really treasure her
 friendship that much,

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:31.330
hurry up and tell her the truth!

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.470
What if she finds out from someone?

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:35.100
Y-Yeah.

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:37.820
You really didn't tell her?

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:39.700
I thought about it.

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:43.390
But, she trusts you so much.

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:44.810
Nagi...

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:46.450
You're a good guy.

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:49.870
I'm sorry I couldn't 
remember your confession!

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:51.640
You don't need to remember it!

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.140
Sorry.

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:56.020
I got held up with the student council—

00:11:56.930 --> 00:11:58.150
Masaomi-san,

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:01.490
this is Maki Natsuo-san. 
She's starting here next week.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:03.940
My name is Maki. It's nice to meet you.

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:05.530
Nice to meet you.

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:08.740
<i>Damn it. If I had just made sure 
of her name in the beginning...</i>

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:11.580
<i>I can't believe how stupid I am.</i>

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:13.830
You like Maki, don't you?

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:16.710
<i>Damned Kurahashi, spouting that crap...</i>

00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:19.360
Yan-san, you're on the 
student council, too?

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:20.620
So am I—

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:21.400
What?

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:22.670
Nothing!

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:26.600
Maki-san, as long as you're here, 
why don't you sit in on a class?

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:28.300
Okay.

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:29.260
But...

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:30.810
What do you want?

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:32.680
I'm leaving!

00:12:33.030 --> 00:12:35.510
<i>Why is he so hostile?</i>

00:12:35.510 --> 00:12:36.790
Why don't you stay?

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:37.360
Huh?

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:39.780
This class is pretty difficult.

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:41.770
There's a lot you'll need to prepare for.

00:12:43.060 --> 00:12:44.530
Just for a bit, then...

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:47.060
<i>Huh? Is he actually a nice person?</i>

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:50.610
You'll need to prepare to change 
courses because you can't keep up.

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:54.340
<i>He's not scary because he's a boy.</i>

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:56.670
<i>He just has a terrible personality.</i>

00:12:56.990 --> 00:13:00.440
Maki-san, how far did your tutor...

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:02.710
What? You've already gone this far?

00:13:03.430 --> 00:13:07.140
I heard you were gifted, 
but this is amazing.

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:09.440
We've only gone this far.

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:14.000
I'm delighted to have more gifted students.

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:16.340
I still have a lot to learn.

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:18.670
There's so much to prepare for.

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:22.360
By the way, Maki-san, I heard 
you're friends with Riko-san?

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:23.530
Yes.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:25.450
Masaomi-san, you're
 friends with her too, right?

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:26.590
How do you figure?!

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:30.040
You helped her study during her 
middle school entrance exams.

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:32.040
You made me do it!

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:36.210
Masaomi-san, you always look like you're 
enjoying yourself when you're with Riko-san.

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:39.140
Please stop presenting your 
own opinions as facts!

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:41.170
You seemed so animated.

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:42.370
Irritated Irritated Irritated

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:42.380
That was irritation!

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:44.490
Why are you being so stubborn?

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:46.780
You're not listening to me, are you?!

00:13:46.900 --> 00:13:51.710
<b>Fantasy</b>

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:51.720
<i>Th-This smells vaguely of love!</i>

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:55.770
<i>Yan-san was all alone because 
of his terrible personality.</i>

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:58.350
<i>Regardless, Riko was friendly to him.</i>

00:13:56.280 --> 00:13:59.020
Aw, Yan, why are you being so shy?

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:00.920
K-K-KuraRiko...

00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:00.940
<i>It was only natural for him to fall in love.</i>

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:03.440
<i>But Riko was popular.</i>

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.690
Come on, guys, cut it out.

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:07.990
<i>His sadness made his already 
terrible personality even worse,</i>

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:09.910
<i>leading to his present situation!</i>

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:11.610
Okay, I get it.

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:14.030
I'll go get study materials for Maki-san.

00:14:14.030 --> 00:14:15.800
You don't get it at all!

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:23.170
Why are you looking at me with an 
expression of understanding and pity?

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:27.920
Adults don't understand 
the pain of the young.

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:30.480
I don't understand, either.

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:34.440
I can guess what you're thinking, 
and just so you know,

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:36.770
I don't think anything of Kurahashi.

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:39.190
Riko is very attractive.

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:40.350
She's popular, too.

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:43.170
Popular? Kurahashi?

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:44.940
What kind of lie is that?

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:48.150
What? It's not a lie.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:50.870
That terrible girl could never be popular.

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.480
B-But you loved her!

00:14:53.480 --> 00:14:54.740
What are you talking about?!

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:56.730
Kurahashi is an insensitive idiot!

00:14:56.730 --> 00:14:58.040
There's nothing to love!

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:01.420
She's my precious friend...

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:04.090
Did your feelings turn sour 
because she rejected you?

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:06.140
Don't accuse me based on a lie!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:12.540
Do you always push people 
around with your assumptions?

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:13.430
What?

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:16.280
Kurahashi must be struggling 
behind the scenes.

00:15:16.470 --> 00:15:19.940
I hope your friendship 
isn't an assumption, too.

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:23.980
<i>Oh, crap. I said too much.</i>

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:29.900
Yan-san, you understand 
people very well, don't you?

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:31.950
What are you...

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:34.530
Because you knew how I felt,

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:37.140
you chose the words that would 
hurt me most, didn't you?

00:15:37.470 --> 00:15:38.870
I'm relieved.

00:15:39.090 --> 00:15:41.520
Now that I know that,

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:44.450
I realize there's no reason 
to trust anything you say.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:49.460
Doing things like that is a 
waste of your intelligence.

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:52.380
I remembered there's something 
I have to do. Excuse me.

00:15:53.210 --> 00:15:54.920
H-Hey...

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.850
Maki, there you are.
 I've been looking...

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:02.940
Riko...

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:04.350
Huh?

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:06.020
Riko!

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:08.940
What's wrong?

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:12.360
I hate Yan-san.

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:15.580
What did Yan do this time?

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:17.850
He said you weren't popular.

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:19.660
That you're a terrible girl.

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:24.460
That my assumptions were 
causing you trouble.

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:28.090
That you actually hate me, 
and our friendship is...

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:31.300
There.

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:33.600
Of course I don't hate you!

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:36.050
If I did, I'd have quit the 
student council long ago.

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:37.970
Riko...

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:40.880
You're still crying?

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:43.090
But, but...

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:47.490
See you tomorrow, Riko.

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:49.400
Yep. Later.

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:55.030
I forgot to tell her again!

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:56.990
<b>After School</b>

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:00.800
<i>Just thinking about it won't do any good.</i>

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:03.710
<i>All I can do now is apologize.</i>

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:07.080
<i>I'll tell Maki as soon as I see her.</i>

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:10.250
Maki, I need to talk to you!

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:12.410
So do I, Master Riko.

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:15.970
Wh-What is it, Maki-kun?

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:17.910
It's about the underground paper.

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:22.140
If this is to move forward secretly, the 
newspaper association will need a club room.

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:25.480
I'm thinking of lending them the 
student council's storage room.

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:28.550
Won't that kind of hospitality 
seem suspicious?

00:17:28.550 --> 00:17:31.160
That's why I'm going to ask 
them to print a special paper

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:33.820
of the student council's announcements.

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:37.420
You want to create the impression the 
paper's assisting the student council

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:39.030
with its public relations.

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:40.070
Yes.

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:44.380
It won't seem strange to lend them our 
storage room or for us to come and go.

00:17:44.650 --> 00:17:45.370
Then...

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:48.370
We can conduct our love 
labs without restraint!

00:17:48.370 --> 00:17:51.250
I wish you'd show <i>some</i> restraint.

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:55.260
The only problem left is the attitude of the
 students reading the underground paper.

00:17:55.480 --> 00:17:59.450
If they treat it carelessly and 
let a teacher see it, it's over.

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:02.060
Let's make them take 
on the same risk, then.

00:18:02.360 --> 00:18:03.100
What?

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:04.790
It won't be a big deal.

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:07.480
They'll have to write their class and 
name on the paper when they get it.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:10.190
To ensure that they won't 
expose it, no matter what.

00:18:10.720 --> 00:18:13.190
Make the readers our partners in crime?

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:15.080
Do you think they'll agree?

00:18:15.080 --> 00:18:17.820
Of course they will. Fuji Girls' is too quiet.

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:21.890
I bet there are plenty of girls who 
want to break out of the mold a little.

00:18:22.140 --> 00:18:23.520
W-Well, yeah.

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:24.540
You're right.

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:29.670
Girls like that won't give up the chance
 to do something as fun as share a secret

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:31.460
and receive romantic advice.

00:18:31.740 --> 00:18:34.210
I may have started conducting 
love labs because...

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:40.360
I wanted to break out of my <i>incredibly</i> 
gifted and <i>incredibly</i> talented self a little.

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:42.290
Don't casually brag about yourself!

00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:43.600
It's more than a little!

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:48.030
I'm really starting to get excited!

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:51.480
<i>If this actually moves forward,</i>

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:53.860
<i>it won't just be a lie in our 
inner circle anymore.</i>

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:56.600
<i>Not that it's okay now 
because it's in my inner circle...</i>

00:18:58.030 --> 00:18:58.940
Riko.

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:00.680
I'm so excited!

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:01.600
Let's run!

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:02.650
All right!

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:03.620
Why?

00:19:04.100 --> 00:19:06.240
She's really agreeable, isn't she?

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:10.000
Sometimes I forget Riko has 
so much romantic experience.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.360
So do I.

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:14.920
She always speaks on our level.

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:17.010
She doesn't brag, either.

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:18.210
About that.

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:22.470
What would you do if all her 
romantic experience was a lie?

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:23.240
What?

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:26.240
That would be terrible.

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:31.020
Maki believes in her so much because 
she has all that romantic experience.

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:34.230
Sayo-senpai, why would you say that?

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:37.150
Oh, no reason.

00:19:40.180 --> 00:19:41.110
Here.

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:43.130
Thanks.

00:19:45.570 --> 00:19:48.290
We conducted love labs with handkerchiefs.

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:51.180
Yeah, we did, didn't we?

00:19:51.490 --> 00:19:54.000
We conducted lots of love labs.

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:56.740
I couldn't always keep up, though.

00:19:56.740 --> 00:20:00.720
Yes, but you'd always do them with me.

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:03.590
I love that about you.

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:08.430
I've had so much fun since I met you.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:12.600
I hope you'll be my friend forever.

00:20:16.050 --> 00:20:18.890
I said it! How embarrassing!

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:21.690
<i>I need to tell her now.</i>

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:23.220
<i>I need to tell her.</i>

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:25.550
Um, Maki!

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:31.220
There's something I've always
 wanted to tell you, but never could.

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:34.360
I, um...

00:20:35.180 --> 00:20:37.390
Me being a master of love...

00:20:37.390 --> 00:20:39.960
Having lots of romantic experience...

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:42.380
It's all actually...

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:46.050
It's all a lie.

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:48.670
I'm actually just like you.

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:51.470
I'm a romantic...

00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:53.370
be—

00:20:54.590 --> 00:20:55.840
beginner!

00:20:57.890 --> 00:20:59.400
What would you think if that were true?

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.400
<i>You're so worthless!</i>

00:21:01.640 --> 00:21:02.760
I mean...

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:04.280
Kurahashi-san!

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:06.780
You're wearing another garish hairband!

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:09.100
Come with me to the 
student guidance office!

00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:17.320
After I finally said it...

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:19.290
Riko.

00:21:20.490 --> 00:21:21.710
Hey, Mika.

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:24.200
You're doing pretty fun things, aren't you?

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:25.510
Like giving romantic advice.

00:21:25.730 --> 00:21:26.480
Huh?

00:21:26.980 --> 00:21:28.180
H-How do you know?

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:29.580
How?

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:31.960
I used to be in the newspaper club.

00:21:31.960 --> 00:21:35.520
I just heard about it from the president. 
I'm going to be helping out a little.

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:36.370
Huh?

00:21:36.370 --> 00:21:40.810
Are you sure you should be 
giving romantic advice, though?

00:21:40.810 --> 00:21:42.530
You have zero experience.

00:21:42.760 --> 00:21:46.840
Th-That's true, but we do our research.

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:50.370
Maki's got a strong sense of 
responsibility, so she wouldn't...

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:51.460
President Maki.

00:21:52.970 --> 00:21:55.680
<i>Crap! Did she hear that?</i>

00:21:56.860 --> 00:22:00.710
M-Maki, did you...

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:03.420
I can't believe you called me responsible!

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:07.200
Hearing you praise me like 
that makes me so excited!

00:22:08.330 --> 00:22:10.230
I'm running to the student council room!

00:22:10.230 --> 00:22:11.100
Again?

00:22:11.100 --> 00:22:12.760
Away!

00:22:13.520 --> 00:22:14.520
See you later.

00:22:15.330 --> 00:22:17.340
Wait up!

00:22:18.660 --> 00:22:20.060
<i>Oh, good...</i>

00:22:20.460 --> 00:22:24.000
<i>I'm glad she didn't hear that.</i>

00:23:57.560 --> 00:24:03.360
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:58.320 --> 00:23:59.620
<i>The final episode, huh?</i>

00:23:59.880 --> 00:24:01.390
<i>It went by so fast.</i>

00:24:01.390 --> 00:24:06.790
<i>Yes. It's been ten years since I found a 
wonderful boyfriend thanks to our love labs.</i>

00:24:06.790 --> 00:24:08.800
<i>It hasn't been that long!</i>

00:24:08.800 --> 00:24:11.680
<i>My brother has moved beyond
 searching for himself, too.</i>

00:24:11.680 --> 00:24:13.520
<i>That'd be great, if it were true!</i>

00:24:13.520 --> 00:24:17.040
<i>I never thought my slapsticks would 
be marketed as merchandise!</i>

00:24:17.040 --> 00:24:19.070
<i>Suzu, don't run with the joke!</i>

00:24:19.070 --> 00:24:22.290
<i>If you want a second season that badly, 
you'll have to pay me 80% more.</i>

00:24:20.950 --> 00:24:27.150
<b>One Hand on Another</b>

00:24:22.290 --> 00:24:25.470
<i>Don't make me come up with 
retorts until the very end!</i>

00:24:27.150 --> 00:24:30.140
<b>Don't miss the next episode!</b>
